            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all 50 changed paths from the patch sections supplied in the prompt; the candidate was fully inspectable.",
              "The change widens the approval digest from SKILL.md alone to every file of the skill and removes the grandfathered exemption, so it tightens the approval gate. The add, approve and validate paths in engine/skills/app/add.go, engine/skills/app/approve.go and engine/skills/app/validate.go all go through the same ReadSkillTree, ReadApprovalStatus and EvaluateApproval flow.",
              "Symlinks and non-regular entries yield an unverifiable verdict, and approve refuses them before writing anything (engine/skills/app/approve.go). Version 1 records are stale and any other version is malformed, so no approval bypass is introduced.",
              "The domain implementations (SkillDigest, skillsfs.ReadSkillTree) are not in this candidate, so the review could not check them. No reachable exploit, secret exposure, or dependency change was found in the visible diff."
